Description: Pin restricted legacy mount targets before canonicalization
 Backport the target-FD lifetime and September legacy mount hardening from
 util-linux, preserving Bookworm's public ABI and all Debian vendor fixes.
 Restricted contexts require openat2 and procfs; no unsafe fallback is used.
Author: Utilibre maintainers <admin@utilibre.org>
Origin: backport, https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/commit/2c773f336134acf016e639abb6f12ba7341fe4b8
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-12

